# MiniMax H3 prompt presets — one env file for this entire prompt category
H3_PRESET_FAMILY="overall_soundscape"
H3_PRESETS_JSON={"ASMR Product":"Highly detailed close-mic material, tapping, sliding, opening and handling sounds with minimal background ambience.","Automotive":"Engine character, road and tire texture, aerodynamic wind and mechanical responses synchronized precisely to vehicle movement.","Beach":"Rhythmic shoreline waves, soft sea breeze, distant seabirds and footsteps interacting naturally with sand.","Beauty Close-Up":"Near-silent studio ambience with delicate brush, skin, hair and product-container Foley.","Café":"Soft café room tone, distant cups, restrained conversation murmur and gentle street ambience without clear background dialogue.","Comic Action":"Exaggerated but synchronized impacts, whooshes and environmental reactions layered over a readable physical ambience.","Desert":"Dry open-air wind, fine sand movement, sparse distant ambience and grounded footsteps on granular terrain.","Dream Ambience":"Soft diffuse environmental tone, distant reversed textures, airy movement and gentle spatial echoes.","Factory":"Layered mechanical ambience, ventilation, restrained machinery cycles and close synchronized work sounds.","Fantasy Forest":"Natural woodland ambience enhanced by sparse shimmering tones, moving leaves and distant nonverbal creatures.","Fashion Runway":"Measured footsteps, subtle fabric movement, restrained room reflections, distant camera shutters and no intelligible crowd speech.","Food Preparation":"Detailed kitchen room tone with precise cutting, pouring, sizzling, utensil and surface-contact sounds.","Forest":"Layered forest ambience with leaves, branches, birds, distant insects and grounded footsteps on natural terrain.","Home Interior":"Warm domestic room tone, light appliance hum, subtle floor contact and close natural movement sounds.","Horror Atmosphere":"Sparse low room tone, distant structural creaks, restrained wind and close unsettling physical detail without musical scoring.","Luxury Showroom":"Quiet premium showroom ambience with soft air conditioning, restrained footsteps and delicate product-handling sounds.","Mountain":"Open mountain wind, distant birds, broad natural reflections and footsteps on rock or gravel.","Natural Outdoor":"Natural outdoor ambience with light wind, distant birds, subtle foliage movement and physically synchronized footsteps.","No Diegetic Sound":"N/A","Office":"Low office room tone, distant keyboard activity, ventilation and subtle movement without intelligible background speech.","Quiet Interior":"Controlled indoor room tone, low ventilation hum, subtle cloth movement and precise close-range object Foley.","Rain":"Consistent rainfall on nearby surfaces, occasional runoff, dampened environmental reflections and synchronized wet footsteps.","Sci-Fi Interior":"Low futuristic power hum, subtle interface tones, ventilation and precise mechanical movement without constant alarms.","Snow":"Muted winter ambience, soft wind, compressed footsteps in snow and restrained clothing movement.","Sports Arena":"Broad arena reflections, restrained distant crowd energy, floor or field contact and clear primary action Foley.","Storm":"Strong wind, layered rain, distant thunder and responsive environmental rattles without overpowering primary action.","Studio Silence":"Near-silent treated studio room tone with only precise subject movement, clothing and product Foley.","Tennis Match":"Court ambience with shoe squeaks, controlled ball impacts, racquet contact, light wind and distant nonverbal spectators.","Tropical Court":"Soft tropical breeze through palm leaves, distant birds, shoe contact on the court and restrained equipment or clothing movement.","Urban Day":"Layered daytime city ambience with distant traffic, soft pedestrian presence, building reflections and close synchronized footsteps.","Urban Night":"Distant night traffic, low electrical hum, occasional tire movement, sparse city echoes and close physical Foley.","Warehouse":"Large industrial room tone, distant mechanical hum, long reflections and weighty footsteps on concrete."}
